      "durationSeconds": 10.633333333333333,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "opening-0-74d30f158a.m4a",
          "text": "今天，一起听一个狐假虎威的故事。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 89,
          "durationSeconds": 2.96
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "opening-1-4754890a1b.m4a",
          "text": "假，是借的意思。狐狸，借了谁的威风呢？",
          "startFrame": 127,
          "durationInFrames": 120,
          "durationSeconds": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "forest",
      "index": "02",
      "title": "大山里的森林",
      "heading": "百兽之家",
      "visual": "forest",
      "startFrame": 319,
      "durationInFrames": 298,
      "durationSeconds": 9.933333333333334,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "forest-0-d50df6b203.m4a",
          "text": "大山里有一片森林，住着许多动物。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 87,
          "durationSeconds": 2.88
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "forest-1-dcb3898662.m4a",
          "text": "其中最威风的，是一只大老虎。",
          "startFrame": 125,
          "durationInFrames": 101,
          "durationSeconds": 3.36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "caught",
      "index": "03",
      "title": "老虎的午餐",
      "heading": "被扑住的狐狸",
      "visual": "caught",
      "startFrame": 617,
      "durationInFrames": 286,
      "durationSeconds": 9.533333333333333,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "caught-0-15c7881e06.m4a",
          "text": "这天，老虎扑住了一只狐狸。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 84,
          "durationSeconds": 2.8
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "caught-1-2dde9f0280.m4a",
          "text": "哈哈，今天的午餐，有着落啦！",
          "startFrame": 122,
          "durationInFrames": 92,
          "durationSeconds": 3.04
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trick",
      "index": "04",
      "title": "眼珠一转",
      "heading": "天帝派来的王",
      "visual": "trick",
      "startFrame": 903,
      "durationInFrames": 289,
      "durationSeconds": 9.633333333333333,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "trick-0-b2ea261df2.m4a",
          "text": "狐狸眼珠一转，计上心来。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 75,
          "durationSeconds": 2.48
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "trick-1-3bfacbd19d.m4a",
          "text": "慢着！我是天帝派来的百兽之王，你敢吃我吗？",
          "startFrame": 113,
          "durationInFrames": 104,
          "durationSeconds": 3.44
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parade",
      "index": "05",
      "title": "狐狸走在前面",
      "heading": "走一圈看看",
      "visual": "parade",
      "startFrame": 1192,
      "durationInFrames": 342,
      "durationSeconds": 11.4,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "parade-0-27e0b75619.m4a",
          "text": "狐狸说：你跟在我后面走一圈，看看百兽见了谁敢不逃。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 140,
          "durationSeconds": 4.64
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "parade-1-68f8bde941.m4a",
          "text": "老虎半信半疑，跟在了狐狸身后。",
          "startFrame": 178,
          "durationInFrames": 92,
          "durationSeconds": 3.04
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flee",
      "index": "06",
      "title": "吓跑的百兽",
      "heading": "全都跑了",
      "visual": "flee",
      "startFrame": 1534,
      "durationInFrames": 392,
      "durationSeconds": 13.066666666666666,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "flee-0-cb9ba4b958.m4a",
          "text": "森林里的动物，看见狐狸身后的大老虎，吓得四散奔逃。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 159,
          "durationSeconds": 5.28
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "flee-1-a93b60df0c.m4a",
          "text": "小鹿、野猪、兔子，一眨眼全都跑光了。",
          "startFrame": 197,
          "durationInFrames": 123,
          "durationSeconds": 4.08
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "index": "07",
      "title": "小笔记",
      "heading": "威风是谁的",
      "visual": "lesson",
      "startFrame": 1926,
      "durationInFrames": 286,
      "durationSeconds": 9.533333333333333,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "lesson-0-56187fec49.m4a",
          "text": "动物们害怕的，其实是狐狸身后的老虎。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 92,
          "durationSeconds": 3.04
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "lesson-1-767f6b5aee.m4a",
          "text": "狐狸借着老虎的威风，吓走了大家。",
          "startFrame": 130,
          "durationInFrames": 84,
          "durationSeconds": 2.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
