        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "ending-0-633e4d34fa.m4a",
          "text": "狐假虎威，你学会了吗？",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 70,
          "durationSeconds": 2.32
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "ending-1-c31b71bca7.m4a",
          "text": "想想看：威风是自己的本事，还是借来的架子呢？下集再见。",
